module

/-!
# ptmalloc: generated allocator facts of the pinned libc builds

GENERATED by an untrusted generator (readelf, objdump, gdb `ptype /o`) from each pinned
`libc.so.6` (sha256 checked) and its `libc6-dbg` debug file (by build id). Do not edit by hand.
Key scheme: `sym:`/`size:` symbols, `got:` GOT slots read by the allocator, `tunable:` ids,
`mp_init:` initial `mp_` words, `<struct>.<field>`/`sizeof:<struct>` DWARF layouts, `image_end`.
The hand-written records (`pin236`, `pin239`, `pin240`) are checked against these lists by
`decide` in `Silmaril.Libc.Ptmalloc.Version.Thms`.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace Silmaril.Libc.Ptmalloc.Versions

